# Software industry mapping for LIC
@prefix sw: <https://ecosystemcode.com/ontology/lic/software#> .
@prefix legacy: <https://example.com/legacy/software#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

legacy:saa_s_license_agreement owl:equivalentClass sw:SaaSLicenseAgreement .
legacy:saa_s_license_agreement_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:saaSLicenseAgreementId .
legacy:covers_software_tenant rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:coversSoftwareTenant .
legacy:licenses_product_edition rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:licensesProductEdition .
